# Kbd

Displays a keyboard key, such as a modifier, a letter, or an icon. Renders a `kbd` element.

<Demo />

```svelte title="+page.svelte"
<script lang="ts">
	import { Kbd } from "#lib/components/ui/kbd/index.js";
	import { CommandIcon } from "@lucide/svelte";
</script>

<Kbd>⌘</Kbd>
<Kbd>Ctrl</Kbd>
<Kbd><CommandIcon /></Kbd>
```

## Installation

```pm
npx remote0 add https://plainsv.com/r/kbd.json
```

## Group

Wrap the keys of a shortcut in `KbdGroup`. It renders a `kbd` that holds the key elements, which is how HTML marks keys pressed together. Place text such as `+` between keys when the platform needs it.

<Demo section="group" />

```svelte title="+page.svelte"
<script lang="ts">
	import { Kbd, KbdGroup } from "#lib/components/ui/kbd/index.js";
</script>

<p>
	Use <KbdGroup><Kbd>⌘</Kbd><Kbd>K</Kbd></KbdGroup> to open the command menu.
</p>
```

## In a button

Place a key inside a `Button` to hint at its shortcut.

<Demo section="button" />

```svelte title="+page.svelte"
<script lang="ts">
	import { Kbd } from "#lib/components/ui/kbd/index.js";
	import { Button } from "#lib/components/ui/button/index.js";
	import { CornerDownLeftIcon } from "@lucide/svelte";
</script>

<Button variant="outline">Accept <Kbd><CornerDownLeftIcon /></Kbd></Button>
```

## Sizes

Set `size` to `xs`, `sm`, `md`, or `lg`. The default is `md`, a 20 pixel key like the shadcn kbd.

<Demo section="sizes" />

```svelte title="+page.svelte"
<Kbd size="lg">⌘</Kbd>
```

## Rounded

The corner radius stays one step smaller than the size, so keys keep square corners. Set `rounded` to `xs` through `4xl` or `pill` to override it.

<Demo section="rounded" />

```svelte title="+page.svelte"
<Kbd rounded="pill">⌘</Kbd>
```

## API

`Kbd` and `KbdGroup` extend the native `kbd` attributes.

```ts title="index.ts"
interface Props extends CompPropsWithChild<"kbd"> {
	/** Height, padding, text, and icon size on the shared scale; defaults to `md` */
	size?: UiSize;
	/** Corner radius; one step smaller than `size` when omitted, like shadcn, so the key stays square-cornered */
	rounded?: UiRounded;
}

interface GroupProps extends CompPropsWithChild<"kbd"> {}
```
